  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Borlaug Fellowship Program - Animal Health Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This award seeks to address ongoing Kenyan food safety issues through a focus on animal health. Intending to empower states and county governments, Kenya decentralized its animal health and veterinary service delivery systems, leading to a breakdown in disease control reporting and service delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
